hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1150","From us Ismail bin Bishr bin Mansour Al-Sulaimi, from us Abdul-Ala, on the authority of Hisham, on the authority of Muhammad, on the authority of Abu Hurairah, on the authority of the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace May God bless him and grant him peace. He said: “When one of you gets up at night, let him begin his prayer with two light rak’ahs.”"
